{
  "evt.story_opening.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "九月的校门口人潮涌动。",
      "奶娃拖着行李箱，站在了大学的第一块地砖上。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "告示牌上写着：",
      "大学四年，每学期两天，每天三件事。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "操作提示：WASD 移动，E 互动。",
      "Tab 查看状态，Esc 打开菜单。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.4": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "今天的目标只有一个：",
      "去任意地点，做一件想做的事。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.story_opening.body.5": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "深呼吸。",
      "大学生活，开始了！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "招新海报缺人手贴。",
      "符闹吃抱着一卷海报跑过广场。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃接过一半。",
      "两个人跑遍了三栋教学楼。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_happy",
    "lines": [
      "够意思！",
      "明天的招新，全靠咱们了！"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "活动前夜，场地突然被占。",
      "符闹吃第一次露出慌张的神色。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃提议去旧礼堂试试。",
      "两个人磨了半个小时，借到了钥匙。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "深夜的旧礼堂，桌椅一张张摆好。",
      "符闹吃长长地出了一口气。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_2.body.4": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_happy",
    "lines": [
      "幸好有你。",
      "这种事，我可一个人干不来。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "毕业季临近，社团要换负责人了。",
      "符闹吃把一串钥匙放在奶娃面前。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "活动室、储物柜、荣誉柜。",
      "这串钥匙，我交给你了。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_sumo_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "钥匙比想象中沉。",
      "那是一整届活动的心血。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "图书馆里，李振兴的笔突然没水了。",
      "他捏着笔杆，愣了两秒。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃默默递过去一支。",
      "李振兴小声道谢，耳根有点热。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "……谢了。",
      "下次，我请你喝图书馆的咖啡。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "期末临近，奶娃的错题本摊在桌上。",
      "李振兴主动坐到了对面。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "两个人把错题按类型分好，",
      "一道一道重新演算。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "你的思路其实很有意思。",
      "只是太跳跃了，要稳一点。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_2.body.4": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "合上错题本时，天已经黑了。",
      "但两个人都觉得，今晚值了。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "黄昏的图书馆只剩窗边一盏灯。",
      "李振兴难得地没有做题。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_happy",
    "lines": [
      "我想读研。",
      "这里的一切，我还想再看四年。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_chenlang_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃没有说话，只是点了点头。",
      "有些梦想，不需要形容词。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "食堂角落，奈珑边吃边画。",
      "速写本上是整个食堂的热闹。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "奶娃多看了一眼。",
      "奈珑慌忙合上本子，又慢慢打开。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_1.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "这、这张还没画完……",
      "不过，你可以看。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "一款很难的游戏，卡了两个星期。",
      "奈珑发来消息：要不……组队？"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "两个人轮流上阵，",
      "凌晨两点，终于通关。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_2.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "通关了！",
      "……和你一起，好像没那么难。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "系里的合作画布创作开放了。",
      "奈珑犹豫了很久，开口邀请奶娃。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "一个人的线条，另一个人的颜色。",
      "画布上慢慢长出一幅完整的画。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.rel_npc_xiaoyou_3.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_happy",
    "lines": [
      "原来合作是这个感觉。",
      "像有人陪着一起做梦。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "开学第二周，校园广场挤满了招新摊位。",
      "三个方向同时向奶娃发来邀请。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "符闹吃把报名表拍到桌上：",
      "“来技术社团，今天就能开工！”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.3": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "李振兴指了指实验室：",
      "“先看看这里，也许你会喜欢。”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_1_club_fair.body.4": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_surprised",
    "lines": [
      "奈珑抱着同好会海报，小声说：",
      "“要不要一起去逛展？”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_2_first_exam.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "第一次测验前，复习室的灯亮到很晚。",
      "奶娃必须决定今晚怎么安排。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_2_first_exam.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "时间不够用了。",
      "每种选择都会留下代价。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_3_art_contest.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "校园创作征集开始了。",
      "同一周，社团服务器也出了故障。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_3_art_contest.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "奈珑抱着作品文件夹：",
      "“如果你愿意，我想和你一起把它完成。”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_4_sports_meet.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "校园文化周开始，操场和活动中心都忙成一团。",
      "每个人都在寻找自己的位置。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_4_sports_meet.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "有人冲向人群，有人留在安静的自习室。",
      "奶娃也要做出选择。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_5_club_election.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "大三的换届名单即将公布。",
      "社团和未来都在等一个决定。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_5_club_election.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_sumo",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_sumo_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "符闹吃指着白板上的架构图：",
      "“我们一起把这个项目做成真正的开源框架。”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_6_lab_invite.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "课程、社团和未来方向同时撞在了一起。",
      "每条路都需要付出时间。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_6_lab_invite.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_chenlang",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_chenlang_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "李振兴在图书馆留了两个固定座位：",
      "“一起准备考研吗？”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_7_final_project.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "毕业设计和最后的选择同时到来。",
      "校园里的每一条路都通向不同的明天。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_7_final_project.body.2": {
    "speaker": "npc_xiaoyou",
    "portrait": "portrait_npc_xiaoyou_neutral",
    "lines": [
      "奈珑抱着刚打印的设定集：",
      "“Game Jam 结束后，我有句话想告诉你。”"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_8_graduation_eve.body.1": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "毕业答辩结束，教务系统开始核查学分。",
      "四年的选择将在今天留下结果。"
    ]
  },
  "evt.sem_8_graduation_eve.body.2": {
    "speaker": null,
    "portrait": null,
    "lines": [
      "窗外有人在拍毕业照。",
      "奶娃打开了最后一封通知。"
    ]
  }
}
